// Weapon-cantrip delivered as a melee strike. MeleeConstructorKind has no
// damage_kind field -- every kind hardcodes its own DamageKind in
// common/src/comp/melee.rs (Stab/Hook->Piercing, Slash->Slashing,
// Bash->Crushing, Sear->Energy). No kind produces Thunder. Bash is picked
// here for its built-in Knockback(Away) rider, which fits "the blow rings
// with crashing sound" reasonably well; the true in-engine damage type is
// Crushing, not Thunder -- flavor-only mismatch, same as every other
// BasicMelee spell in this batch.
//
// The sheet's on-move rider ("additional thunder damage if the target
// moves before the caster's next turn") is dropped: no movement-triggered
// combat effect exists anywhere in common/src/combat.rs or comp/buff.rs.
BasicMelee(
    energy_cost: 0,
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    swing_duration: 0.1,
    hit_timing: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    melee_constructor: (
        kind: Bash(damage: 14, poise: 5, knockback: 3, energy_regen: 0),
        range: 3.0,
        angle: 20.0,
    ),
    meta: (school: Some(Evocation), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
